# 31. Important: Do Not Use the Wrong User Name

We encountered this error:

```text
Cannot find the user 'Dapper', because it does not exist
or you do not have permission.

The login already has an account under a different user name.
```

This happened because the database user and login names were being confused.

The correct identity is:

```text
IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD
```

not:

```text
Dapper
```

The database is:

```text
Dapper
```

The IIS identity is:

```text
IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD
```

These are two completely different things.

