# 33. Grant Permission to All Required Procedures

In SSMS, select the `Dapper` database and execute:

```sql
USE Dapper;
GO

GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_AddEmp TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_AddManager TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_DeleteEmployee TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_GetEmployee TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_GetEmployeeById TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_GetManagerById TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_GetManagers TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_UpdateEmployee TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GRANT EXECUTE ON dbo.sp_UpdatEmployees TO [IIS APPPOOL\Dapper_CRUD];
GO
```

This is based on the stored procedure list you provided.

