# 51. Important Deployment Rule

After changing:

```text
appsettings.json
Program.cs
Controllers
Services
Models
```

you need to publish the updated application again.

For example:

```powershell
dotnet publish -c Release -o D:\IIS-Publish
```

Then recycle the Application Pool.

Do not change the source code and assume IIS automatically gets the changes.

