# 52. Recommended Update/Deployment Process

For future releases:

```text
1. Get latest source code
        ↓
2. Build
        ↓
3. Test
        ↓
4. Publish
        ↓
5. Backup existing IIS application
        ↓
6. Copy new published files
        ↓
7. Verify configuration
        ↓
8. Recycle Application Pool
        ↓
9. Test API
```

If using Git:

```powershell
git pull
```

Then:

```powershell
dotnet restore
```

Then:

```powershell
dotnet build
```

Then:

```powershell
dotnet publish -c Release -o D:\IIS-Publish
```

